{"id":"15263338","articleId":"13364163","title":"Geographic Restrictions","description":"Countries and regions where Polymarket is restricted","blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Polymarket is not available in certain countries and regions due to regulatory requirements and compliance with international sanctions. This page provides a comprehensive list of all geographically restricted locations.","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Polymarket strictly prohibits the use of VPNs or similar tools to bypass geographic restrictions. Such actions are considered violations of the platform's Terms of Service (Section 2.1.4). Users are required to comply with these guidelines to avoid penalties.","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" ","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" ","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"subheading","text":"<b>​Server Infrastructure</b>","idAttribute":"h_eb5834678c"},{"type":"unorderedNestedList","text":"- <b>Primary Servers</b>: eu-west-2\n- <b>Closest Non-Georestricted Region</b>: eu-west-1","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"<b>Primary Servers</b>: eu-west-2","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"<b>Closest Non-Georestricted Region</b>: eu-west-1","class":"no-margin"}]}]},{"type":"subheading","text":"<b>​Blocked Countries</b>","idAttribute":"h_d444dd68f8"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"The following <b>39 countries</b> are completely restricted from accessing Polymarket:","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"table","responsive":false,"container":false,"stacked":true,"rows":[{"cells":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"<b>Country Code</b>","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"<b>Country Name</b>","class":"no-margin"}]}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"AU","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Australia","class":"no-margin"}]}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"BE","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content"