ly blocked countries, the following specific regions within otherwise accessible countries are also restricted:","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"table","responsive":false,"container":false,"stacked":true,"rows":[{"cells":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"<b>Country</b>","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"<b>Region</b>","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"<b>Region Code</b>","class":"no-margin"}]}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Canada (CA)","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Alberta","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"AB","class":"no-margin"}]}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Canada (CA)","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"British Columbia","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"BC","class":"no-margin"}]}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Canada (CA)","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ontario","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ON","class":"no-margin"}]}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Canada (CA)","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Quebec","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"QC","class":"no-margin"}]}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ukraine (UA)","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Crimea","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"43","class":"no-margin"}]}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ukraine (UA)","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Donetsk","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"14","class":"no-margin"}]}]},{"cells":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ukraine (UA)","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Luhansk","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"09","class":"no-margin"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Country-specific examples include:","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"unorderedNestedList","text":"- <b>Ontario, Canada</b>: Trading services are unavailable. Users can access market data globally but cannot deposit or trade, including via the iOS app.\n- <b>Italy</b>: Trading is restricted. Users can view markets and data but cannot trade.\n- <b>Germany</b>: Trading is prohibited. Existing positions must be held until market resolution to redeem shares, after which funds can be withdrawn without restrictions. Market data and commenting features are available.","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"<b>Ontario, Canada</b>: Trading services are unavailable. Users can access market data globally but cannot deposit or trade, including via the iOS app.","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"<b>Italy</b>: Trading is restricted. Users can view markets and data but cannot trade.","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"<b>Germany</b>: Trading is prohibited. Existing positions must be held until market resolution to redeem shares, after which funds can be withdrawn without restrictions. Market data and commenting features are available.","class":"no-margin"}]}]},{"type":"subheading","text":"<b>​Blocking Logic</b>","idAttribute":"h_19b36aa638"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"The geoblocking system includes:","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"orderedNestedList","text":"1. <b>OFAC-Sanctioned Countries</b>: Countries sanctioned by the U.S. Office of Foreign Assets Control (OFAC)\n2. <b>Additional Regulatory Restrictions</b>: Countries added for specific regulatory compliance reasons","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"<b>OFAC-Sanctioned Countries</b>: Countries sanctioned by the U.S. Office of Foreign Assets Control (OFAC)","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"<b>Additional Regulatory Restrictions</b>: Countries added for specific regulatory compliance reasons","class":"no-margin"}]}]},{"type":"subheading","text":"<b>​Close-Only Countries</b>","idAttribute":"h_ad08d8765e"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Some countries have a <b>“close-only”</b> restriction status. Users in these countries can:","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"unorderedNestedList","text":"- ✅ Close existing positions\n- ❌ Open new positions","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"✅ Close existing positions","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"❌ Open new positions","class":"no-margin"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Countries with close-only status include:","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"unorderedNestedList","text":"- Singapore (SG)\n- Poland (PL)\n- Thailand (TH)\n- Taiwan (TW) For example:\n- Singapore (SG): Users may close their existing positions but cannot open new ones and should adhere to all local trading laws.\n- Poland (PL): Users may view market data and close-out positions only, no new position-taking is allowed.","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Singapore (SG)","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Poland (PL)","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Thailand (TH)","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Taiwan (TW) For example:","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Singapore (SG): Users may close their existing positions but cannot open new ones and should adhere to all local trading laws.","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Poland (PL): Users may view market data and close-out positions only, no new position-taking is allowed.","class":"no-margin"}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Trading While Traveling","idAttribute":"h_62169dc325"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Polymarket allows trading for users traveling to non-restricted countries. Permissions are based on physical location rather than residency; for instance, users traveling to non-restricted regions, such as Bulgaria, can continue to trade.","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" ","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"subheading","text":"<b>​Why These Restrictions?</b>","idAttribute":"h_00f80aafbe"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Geographic restrictions are implemented to ensure compliance with:","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"unorderedNestedList","text":"- International sanctions and embargoes\n- Local financial regulations\n- Gambling and prediction market laws\n- Anti-money laundering (AML) requirements\n- Know Your Customer (KYC) regulations","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"International sanctions and embargoes","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Local financial regulations","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Gambling and prediction market laws","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Anti-money laundering (AML) requirements","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Know Your Customer (KYC) regulations","class":"no-margin"}]}]},{"type":"subheading","text":"<b>​Need Help?</b>","idAttribute":"h_6c3bbb7f9b"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"If you believe you are incorrectly restricted or have questions about geographic availability, please contact Polymarket Support","class":"no-margin"}],"markdown":null,"author":null,"collectionId":"17859622","targetUserType":"everyone","lastUpdated":"Updated this week","lastUpdatedDate":"2026-08-14T11:58:39Z","showTableOfContents":true,"synced":false,"relatedArticles":[{"title":"Website vs App - What's the Difference?","url":"https://help.polymarket.com/en/articles/15458828-website-vs-app-what-s-the-difference"}],"locale":"en","breadcrumbs":[{"url":"https://help.polymarket.com/en/collections/17859622-faqs","name":"FAQs"}],"canonicalUrl":"https://help.polymarket.com/en/articles/13364163-geographic-restrictions","selectedReaction":null,"showReactions":true}